@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title migrationjob
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "migrationjob" as migrationjob {
  class "MigrationApplication" as C0 {
    + {static} void main(String[])
    ~ {static} BeanFactoryPostProcessor validateJob(Environment)
  }
  class "SolrToQdrantMigrator" as C1 {
    - {static} Logger LOGGER
    - SolrAudiobookRepository source
    - QdrantAudiobookRepository destination
    - int batchSize
    - int maximumRecords
    + void run(ApplicationArguments)
  }
}

package "catalogue" as catalogue <<external>> {
}

C1 ..> catalogue : uses

' Source: docs/maintenance.md
note right of migrationjob
  Separate opt-in Solr-to-Qdrant migration.

  Copies supported metadata, short descriptions
  and existing dense vectors.
  Existing destination books are skipped.

  Does not call AI, normalize vectors
  or generate sparse keyword vectors.

  Books without source vectors remain
  without vectors after migration.
end note
@enduml
